## M06 英文读题与正文配词补齐（2026-10-15）

已有概念不改首现；以下只列此前表中未登记的对应词，其余沿用既有词条。正文完整解释与来源在M06各节，英文释义为笔记自拟。

| 中文 | English | 英文短定义（笔记自拟） | 来源 |
|---|---|---|---|
| 数字支付 | Digital payments | Electronic services for sending and receiving payments. | 💡 M06 §2.2 |
| 众筹 | Crowdfunding | Funding raised from multiple contributors under specified terms. | 💡 M06 §2.2 |
| 网络安全 | Cybersecurity | Protection of systems and data against cyber threats. | 💡 M06 §2.3 |
| 稳定币 | Stablecoin | A token designed to track a specified reference value. | 💡 M06 §2.3 |
| 误报 | False alert | A normal activity incorrectly flagged as suspicious. | 💡 M06 §2.3 |
| 固定成本 | Fixed cost | A cost that stays fixed over the activity range assumed. | 💡 M06 §2.5 |
| 可变成本 | Variable cost | A cost that changes with the number of transactions. | 💡 M06 §2.5 |
| 每笔平均成本 | Average cost per transaction | Total relevant processing cost divided by transaction count. | 💡 M06 §2.5 |
| 营运资金缺口 | Working-capital gap | Cash needed for current operations before receipts arrive. | 💡 M06 §2.8 |
| 访问控制 | Access control | Rules determining who may access, approve or change permissions. | 💡 M06 §2.15 |
| 对账 | Reconciliation | Comparing records and resolving differences between them. | 💡 M06 §2.16 |
| 重复融资 | Duplicate financing | Repeated financing against the same receivable, checked against prior funding and the aggregate limit. | 💡 M06 §2.17 |
| 抵押品 | Collateral | Assets pledged or provided to support a financing arrangement. | 💡 M06 §2.24 |
| 信用风险 | Credit risk | The risk that a borrower or counterparty fails to pay as agreed. | 💡 M06 §2.2 |
| 预期信用损失 | Expected credit loss | An estimate of credit losses before actual losses are known. | 💡 M06 §2.25 |

