| 流动性池 | Liquidity pool | Contract-held reserves used for exchanges. | [[EF5560_Fintech_and_AI_in_Finance/notes/M07-比特币以太坊与加密金融商业模式\|M07]] §2.19 | 📄；英文自拟 |
| 流动性提供者 | Liquidity provider | An investor supplying assets to a pool. | [[EF5560_Fintech_and_AI_in_Finance/notes/M07-比特币以太坊与加密金融商业模式\|M07]] §2.19 | 📄；英文自拟 |
| 自动做市商 | Automated market maker | A trading mechanism using a pricing rule. | [[EF5560_Fintech_and_AI_in_Finance/notes/M07-比特币以太坊与加密金融商业模式\|M07]] §2.19 | 📄；英文自拟 |
| 恒定乘积 | Constant product | A simplified rule keeping reserve products fixed. | [[EF5560_Fintech_and_AI_in_Finance/notes/M07-比特币以太坊与加密金融商业模式\|M07]] §2.20 | 📄；英文自拟 |
| 边际价格 | Marginal price | The price for an infinitesimal trade at the current state. | [[EF5560_Fintech_and_AI_in_Finance/notes/M07-比特币以太坊与加密金融商业模式\|M07]] §2.20 | 📄；英文自拟 |
| 价格冲击 | Price impact | A price change caused by the trade itself. | [[EF5560_Fintech_and_AI_in_Finance/notes/M07-比特币以太坊与加密金融商业模式\|M07]] §2.20 | 📄；英文自拟 |
| 永续合约 | Perpetual futures | Derivative contracts without a fixed expiry date. | [[EF5560_Fintech_and_AI_in_Finance/notes/M07-比特币以太坊与加密金融商业模式\|M07]] §2.22 | 📄；英文自拟 |
| 返佣 | Rebates | Fees returned to trading participants. | [[EF5560_Fintech_and_AI_in_Finance/notes/M07-比特币以太坊与加密金融商业模式\|M07]] §2.22 | 📄；英文自拟 |
| 现货 ETF | Spot ETF | Fund shares providing exposure to underlying spot assets. | [[EF5560_Fintech_and_AI_in_Finance/notes/M07-比特币以太坊与加密金融商业模式\|M07]] §2.23 | 📄；英文自拟 |
| 精确率 | Precision | Confirmed positives divided by flagged cases. | [[EF5560_Fintech_and_AI_in_Finance/notes/M07-比特币以太坊与加密金融商业模式\|M07]] §2.25 | 📄；英文自拟 |
| 召回率 | Recall | Detected positives divided by all actual positives. | [[EF5560_Fintech_and_AI_in_Finance/notes/M07-比特币以太坊与加密金融商业模式\|M07]] §2.25 | 📄；英文自拟 |
